# Task: Provision new-user template files

1. Create the file `{{skel_file}}` inside `/etc/skel` containing exactly this single line:

   ```
   {{skel_content}}
   ```

2. Create the user account `{{username}}` with a home directory, so that the account automatically receives a copy of `{{skel_file}}` in its home directory, owned by that user.

Every user created in the future must also receive this file.
